OL,4,BEngland seamer Robinson joins Notts    
OL,5,Bfrom Sussex                            
OL,6,GEngland seamer Ollie Robinson has left 
OL,7,GSussex after 11 years to join          
OL,8,GNottinghamshire for an undisclosed     
OL,9,G"compensation package" on a three-year 
OL,10,Gdeal.                                  
OL,12,FThe 32-year-old had been linked with a 
OL,13,Fmove to Trent Bridge for a number of   
OL,14,Fweeks, with confirmation finally       
OL,15,Fcoming just three weeks after Robinson 
OL,16,Fwas named England's cricketer of the   
OL,17,Fyear for 2026 following his remarkable 
OL,18,Freturn to the Test team.               
